assembly_review.description:
{matches}

Strong matches are suggested; ambiguous parts remain blank. Pickers are not limited to the chosen device, and accept number, input_number and select where a part allows them. Saved choices are kept when editing.

Edit value mappings to choose exact Off/On values, direction values, slider bounds or ordered levels. An oscillation-angle control may have no Off value.

mapping_values.description:
{entity}
Control: {role}

For a direction control, Off means clockwise and On means counter-clockwise, before the Reverse toggle. For a mode control, Off means Manual and On means Auto.

For sliders, list values/options one per line, from low to high. Speed levels are the running speeds; leave the Off option out. Blank fields use automatic values.

{error}

